= a*i+b < (q+1)*m, including negative numerators. The empty sum for n=0 is zero. The formal contract must universally refine actual source execution to this complete formula and must also bind program.vscore.json, solve, arity 1 and typed_total, deterministic, input_preserved, no_external_io, no_floating_point, pure_data and restricted_runtime_only under normative Lean vscore-semantics/0.3 and data-pipeline/0.3. O1 is a mixed source/value guarantee with value_required=true.\",\n  required := true,\n  sourceRefs := [{ documentRef := \"tier2:tier2-source-facets-004:A23\", documentHash := \"sha256:7e8c0d17e78afc93ed267ed2738c4d8d2f739a551f7fe20ff302cecbf8fcd83b\", startByte := 468, endByte := 518, origin := \"explicit\", interpretation := \"Complete floor-sum formula.\" }, { documentRef := \"tier2:tier2-source-facets-004:A23\", documentHash := \"sha256:7e8c0d17e78afc93ed267ed2738c4d8d2f739a551f7fe20ff302cecbf8fcd83b\", startByte := 519, endByte := 572, origin := \"explicit\", interpretation := \"Floor toward negative infinity.\" }, { documentRef := \"tier2:tier2-source-facets-004:A23\", documentHash := \"sha256:7e8c0d17e78afc93ed267ed2738c4d8d2f739a551f7fe20ff302cecbf8fcd83b\", startByte := 573, endByte := 591, origin := \"explicit\", interpretation := \"Empty sum zero.\" }, { documentRef := \"tier2:tier2-source-facets-004:A23\", documentHash := \"sha256:7e8c0d17e78afc93ed267ed2738c4d8d2f739a551f7fe20ff302cecbf8fcd83b\", startByte := 1224, endByte := 1269, origin := \"explicit\", interpretation := \"Preserved public examples.\" }, { documentRef := \"tier2:tier2-source-facets-004:A23\", documentHash := \"sha256:7e8c0d17e78afc93ed267ed2738c4d8d2f739a551f7fe20ff302cecbf8fcd83b\", startByte := 1270, endByte := 1427, origin := \"explicit\", interpretation := \"Example values and universal refinement.\" }, { documentRef := \"tier2:tier2-source-facets-004:A23\", documentHash := \"sha256:7e8c0d17e78afc93ed267ed2738c4d8d2f739a551f7fe20ff302cecbf8fcd83b\", startByte := 1552, end