n vscore-semantics/0.3 and data-pipeline/0.3. For every JSON input {n,m,a,b} satisfying A1, typed representation and result serialization preserve the specified input/output structure and exact ordering; the serialized result is precisely the JSON integer Σ_{i=0}^{n-1} floor((a*i+b)/m). Each floor is the unique integer q satisfying q*m <= a*i+b < (q+1)*m, and n=0 gives zero. Universal source implementation refinement must establish this correspondence. The same formal contract binds program.vscore.json, solve, arity 1 and typed_total, deterministic, input_preserved, no_external_io, no_floating_point, pure_data and restricted_runtime_only. O2 is a mixed source/value guarantee with value_required=true.\",\n  required := true,\n  sourceRefs := [{ documentRef := \"tier2:tier2-source-facets-004:A23\", documentHash := \"sha256:7e8c0d17e78afc93ed267ed2738c4d8d2f739a551f7fe20ff302cecbf8fcd83b\", startByte := 67, endByte := 137, origin := \"explicit\", interpretation := \"Canonical file and entry.\" }, { documentRef := \"tier2:tier2-source-facets-004:A23\", documentHash := \"sha256:7e8c0d17e78afc93ed267ed2738c4d8d2f739a551f7fe20ff302cecbf8fcd83b\", startByte := 138, endByte := 222, origin := \"explicit\", interpretation := \"Typed input/output correspondence.\" }, { documentRef := \"tier2:tier2-source-facets-004:A23\", documentHash := \"sha256:7e8c0d17e78afc93ed267ed2738c4d8d2f739a551f7fe20ff302cecbf8fcd83b\", startByte := 468, endByte := 518, origin := \"explicit\", interpretation := \"Required output formula.\" }, { documentRef := \"tier2:tier2-source-facets-004:A23\", documentHash := \"sha256:7e8c0d17e78afc93ed267ed2738c4d8d2f739a551f7fe20ff302cecbf8fcd83b\", startByte := 519, endByte := 572, origin := \"explicit\", interpretation := \"Mathematical floor.\" }, { documentRef := \"tier2:tier2-source-facets-004:A23\", documentHash := \"sha256:7e8c0d17e78afc93ed267ed2738c4d8d2f739a551f7fe20ff302cecbf8fcd83b\", startByte := 573, endByte := 591, origin := \"explicit\", interpre